        "place": "0.025"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "All QFNs, least density",
      "input": {
        "pkg": "all",
        "filter": "QFN",
        "level": "L",
        "fab": "0.05",
        "place": "0.025"
      }
    }
  ],
  "usage": "Give pkg as one of the listed package names (e.g. 0603, SOIC-8, QFN-32 (5×5, 0.5)) or 'all' with a filter text, the density level M, N or L, and the fabrication and placement tolerances in mm. For one package it returns pad length × width, pad centre spacing C, outer/inner spans Z and G, courtyard, pitch, first-pin position and thermal/tab pad in mm, plus the three density levels side by side under the IPC name; for 'all' a table of every matching package. Use it to draw or check a footprint; for production, recalculate with the exact part's datasheet tolerances.",
  "sources": [
    "IPC-7351B Generic Requirements for Surface Mount Design and Land Pattern Standard, section 3 (land equations, fillet goal tables, courtyard excess)",
    "JEDEC MS-012, MO-153, MO-187, TO-236, TO-261, MO-220 and EIA-481 outlines for the component tolerances (typical values)"
  ]
